ol/db/node.go | Implements ListNodesPaginated function with count and pagination logic |\r\n| hscontrol/db/users.go | Implements ListNodesByUserPaginated for user-filtered pagination |\r\n| hscontrol/db/node_test.go | Adds comprehensive test coverage for pagination functions |\r\n| hscontrol/state/state.go | Adds state layer methods for paginated node listing |\r\n| hscontrol/grpcv1.go | Updates ListNodes handler to support pagination with backward compatibility |\r\n| cmd/headscale/cli/nodes.go | Adds --limit and --offset flags with pagination info display |\r\n| gen/go/headscale/v1/node.pb.go | Generated protobuf code for new pagination fields |\r\n| .github/workflows/test-integration.yaml | Unrelated: adds golang image caching optimization |\r\n| .DS_Store | Unrelated: macOS system file that should not be committed |\r\n| .snapshots/* | Unrelated: third-party tool artifacts that should not be committed |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","commit_id":"37177ada7679228219427a478e64e16bd4a9c9f1","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3022#pullrequestreview-3674816402","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3022","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3022#pullrequestreview-3674816402"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3022"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-17T23:06:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T23:06:39Z","author_association":"NONE","event":"reviewed"},{"url":"https://api.githu